    <string name="sync_synced">Synced</string>
    <string name="sync_explanation">Line-level work is saved on the phone while offline: pick, not picked, pack, check, place, audit, move. On reconnect each action is checked against the version it started from: if nothing changed in Aiku it uploads by itself, otherwise it waits for you in Resolve conflicts. Clocking and state changes need a connection.</string>
